WEBVTT

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:15.990
It's pretty crowded.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.500
That's something we can live with.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.040
He's here!

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:42.230
Now!

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:52.070
Good.

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:54.530
Let's check to make sure!

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:17.550
Whoa, freaky!

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:35.530
Hold on.

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:37.200
I'm calling an ambulance.

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:40.870
<i>No gracias. No thank you.</i>

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:42.080
Leave me be.

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:44.080
Japanese?

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:46.580
But what about your wounds?

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:48.830
Don't worry about me.

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:16.320
<i>Those muscles... those scars...</i>

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:20.490
<i>He has the smell of a criminal about him.</i>

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:23.120
<i>Is he really Japanese?</i>

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:30.880
Relax.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:34.090
I'm Krista. I'm not your enemy.

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:35.090
Wh...

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:37.090
Where am I?

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:38.420
My apartment.

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:41.260
You were in an accident and I brought you here.

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:42.600
You should rest for a while.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.400
That's his car. No mistaking it.

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:55.320
To think that he lived through that bomb blast...

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:58.150
Let's search for him! He can't have gone far!

00:02:58.150 --> 00:02:59.320
Gentlemen.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:02.320
So you're looking for the man who drove the car?

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:04.330
Do you know?

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:07.830
Only if I have this.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.580
Thanks for your help.

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:16.090
Wait! You can't go like that!

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:19.630
What did I tell you?

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.100
Here, drink.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:30.100
There's no time, I have to go.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:32.350
Now wait!

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:34.230
Why are you being so rude?

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:37.480
First of all, you just received care from someone!

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:40.610
Won't you at least tell me your name when you leave?

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.240
Name?

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.240
My name...?

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:47.740
Who the devil... am I?

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:54.920
I walk unsteadily on paths to nowhere

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:59.050
wondering what I should do right now.

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:05.510
I play the song you like on the car stereo

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:10.060
with the volume up and my feelings crystallized

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:15.690
driving on streets with no crossroads or signals

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:21.110
with a speed that will catch up with you.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:25.570
So faraway - let's run!

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:31.870
And let's not bother with the breaks - full throttle.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:36.170
Oh someday - one of these days

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:41.260
You'll be at my place where nobody can find you.

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:47.350
Whenever you suffer a breakdown one can't see

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:52.930
depend on me for your repairs.

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:57.310
So faraway - let's run!

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:03.530
We'll reset and start again - even at our limit.

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:07.820
Oh someday - one of these days

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:13.870
If I'm with you we'll find our dream.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:24.170
The Lost Assignment

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:24.010
This is low!

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:44.690
You don't have anything that could identify you.

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:48.700
But I think you might be Japanese.

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:52.740
You spoke instinctively in Japanese while in that wreck.

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:57.960
Plus that move you pulled earlier was Japanese kobudo, right?

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:03.000
I can't. I can't remember.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:05.010
All I know is...

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:09.220
...I need to go somewhere and do something.

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:11.260
Go somewhere?

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.060
That symbol...

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:20.650
Do you remember?

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:25.070
André... the Triangle.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:31.490
He's supposed to be the number-one
professional carjacker in Southern Europe.

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:34.990
Carjacker? So that means you <i>are</i>  a...

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:37.500
André.

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:41.420
André at Pepes Street.

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:43.420
Wait!

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:46.510
You can't! Tonight you need to rest!

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:48.720
No, I have to leave now.

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.550
Something inside me is saying "go now!"

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:06.570
So... your name is Togo huh?

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:11.570
Now you know where you can find another car.

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:14.950
Now you should be able to sleep tonight.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:17.580
I have a favor to ask you.

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:20.580
Let me borrow this car.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.710
Don't be stupid!

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:27.550
Now get in already. I'll also be driving in the morning.

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:45.020
Hmm?

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:25.650
A Japanese like you used to train me.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:28.690
Are you okay?

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:32.190
Who are these guys?

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:51.260
<i>This man is so strong-willed.</i>

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:56.510
<i>His wounds are probably too serious to allow for such movements.</i>

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:02.180
You nincompoop!

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:07.520
Please accept my apologies.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:12.440
Our leader is going to execute his plan tomorrow.

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:16.490
You need to take care of Golgo by today.

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:17.950
Yes sir.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:21.950
You're going to go to the village where our leader is located right now.

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:26.710
If he's trying to take out our leader, then you will definitely find him there.

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:27.960
Yes sir!

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.720
You can leave me here.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:41.760
Please go.

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:44.100
What are you saying?

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:46.730
They know where my apartment is now!

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:52.230
Even if we part ways, they will still be after me!

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:56.740
Why are you in such a hurry? Is someone trying to kill you?

00:09:56.740 --> 00:10:00.780
Until I know everything, I'm not leaving!

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:15.010
Found it.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:59.180
Why are there so many...

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:03.180
It's him!

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:25.530
It's going to be you, Father Vernon, who is going to look after the monarch.

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:27.370
Are you sure?

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:31.040
You're really going to entrust a novice like me with such an enormous task?

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:34.290
You are held to high esteem by the villagers.

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:42.050
With you in stead, the villagers will come together to keep the terrorists away from the king.

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:47.060
So... they're really are trying to kill the king?

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:50.100
We can never be too cautious.

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:56.070
I hear that the authorities don't even know who the head of the terror group is.

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:59.110
I'll will pray for God's divine protection.

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:01.820
So that's what's going on.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:07.450
The Cross.

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:10.960
Do you remember something?

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.460
Let's hurry and look for somewhere to rest.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.460
Get to the church.

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:18.420
Huh?

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:42.860
Our locality is currently increasing its autonomy.

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:45.570
Enough so that we can live in co-existence with our neighboring countries.

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:52.750
Tomorrow's visit of His Majesty to our village will represent a symbol of reconciliation.

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:58.250
Let's open up this village for a warm reception.

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:04.220
So let us give thanks to our God who gave us this...

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:02.260
This way, please.

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:07.930
You may rest here as long as you like.

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:11.270
Thank you very much.

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:13.600
What's that?

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:16.650
Oh, so it's still here.

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:25.780
The last lodger we had here a few days ago left that for us to dispose of, saying it was getting too old.

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:28.870
Now we know.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:32.120
It looks like you handled a lot of guns in your life.

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:38.290
What are you doing?

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:42.300
The trigger spring was loose.

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:52.310
Have you remembered something?

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:54.930
No.

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:56.770
It's just my reflexes.

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:26.130
Can't you sleep?

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:28.970
There's no time.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:31.180
Something in my head is telling me to leave.

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:33.850
I'll get you some water.

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:35.890
Wait.

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:42.650
We'll beat them back no matter how many times they come!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:00.210
Don't move!

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:04.170
Move and she's done for!

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:35.160
I...

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:42.420
We're going.

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:44.170
The men outside will be coming.

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:53.840
They're getting away! After 'em!

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:54.720
Wait!

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:58.680
We got orders not to chase them!

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:00.390
But...

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:05.520
We fed a leak to the police and now they're chasing them.

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:09.280
We told them a suspicious oriental is trying to kill the king.

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:10.690
Understood!

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:12.700
We've got preparations to take care of.

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:22.790
Why did you...?

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:26.290
I held on to it unknowingly.

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:40.520
You probably think, "All she did was kill a guy."

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:44.810
"And she acted so tough all this time. How pathetic."

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:50.820
It wasn't my dream to become the kind of woman I am now.

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:55.860
I was raped. Back when I was eighteen.

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:58.830
But what really devastated me...

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:04.830
...was the fact that my boyfriend I was with at the time ran away without doing a thing.

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:07.460
"I will be strong."

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:10.840
That's what I kept repeating to myself as I lived on my own these past ten years.

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:12.880
But...

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:16.890
After meeting a man as powerful as yourself...

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:19.850
...I really am just another woman.

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:03.450
<i>This is where I shoot. No mistake.</i>

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:06.500
<i>But who's the target?</i>

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:17.010
What!

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:17.510
What?!

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:28.600
Over there!

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:30.270
Fire!

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:39.360
You guys don't let him get away!

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:45.490
What on earth?

00:19:57.800 --> 00:19:59.300
<i>I beg you!</i>

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:01.050
<i>Duke Togo!</i>

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:05.050
<i>There isn't any time!</i>

00:20:05.050 --> 00:20:09.890
<i>I want you to do everything in your power to prevent the king's assassination!</i>

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:14.860
<i>No, that alone won't be enough.</i>

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:20.490
<i>If we leave the leader alone, the terror group will just come back as strong as ever.</i>

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:25.070
<i>So we need to do whatever it takes to hold them back.</i>

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:29.790
<i>I will now tell you the true identity of the leader.</i>

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:31.870
<i>His name is...</i>

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:51.730
Our one chance in a lifetime...

00:20:59.780 --> 00:21:03.740
You went ahead and did that... because now you remember everything.

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:07.780
I thought you had the smell of a criminal about you...

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:12.750
...but I never imagined that you're a professional hit man.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:16.460
But... go ahead.

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.750
I'd rather be killed by you.

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:23.760
You can't allow me to live if I saw you at work.

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:41.530
Meeting you was a blessing.

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:44.070
I became a woman again.

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:46.530
What is my name?

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:48.570
Krista.

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:05.590
There's no one here!

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:08.590
Wait!

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:10.550
Who is this woman?

00:22:43.840 --> 00:22:47.130
I  was worried with no one to talk to.

00:22:47.130 --> 00:22:50.180
I was brooding and standing still

00:22:50.180 --> 00:22:52.350
without moving a muscle.

00:22:53.010 --> 00:22:55.520
I wonder when that was?

00:22:56.020 --> 00:22:57.230
I'm sure

00:22:57.230 --> 00:23:00.400
you agonized over how

00:23:00.400 --> 00:23:05.650
people will hurt themselves and other people

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:08.900
and fail to realize it.

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:10.030
When

00:23:10.030 --> 00:23:13.450
the same days keep repeating themselves

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:15.700
you never change.

00:23:16.410 --> 00:23:17.950
Since you're here for me

00:23:17.950 --> 00:23:22.250
I will accept the way that I am.

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:26.500
I will never leave you alone

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:29.840
I will softly touch your trembling heart.

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:36.720
I realized that I'm not the only one who's alone.

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:39.890
We're enveloped in the gentle sun beams.

00:23:39.890 --> 00:23:43.230
The long winter is finally over.

00:23:43.230 --> 00:23:49.860
The parts of us that were lonely will surely get stronger.

00:24:01.790 --> 00:24:07.420
Big time plutocrat Rockford planned to hire Golgo's sniping skills full-time.

00:24:07.840 --> 00:24:13.840
After being refused, he uses every tough measures
and any means necessary to get him in his clutches.

00:24:13.840 --> 00:24:20.230
How will Golgo resolve his feud with a man who controls all the economic and political levers?

00:24:20.060 --> 00:24:25.560
Rockford's Ambitions

00:24:20.230 --> 00:24:24.100
Next time on Golgo 13: Rockford's Ambitions.

00:24:24.100 --> 00:24:27.820
Don't stand behind him, if you value your life.
